msgid "plugins.generic.preReviewCheck.name"
msgstr "Technical Pre-Review Check"

msgid "plugins.generic.preReviewCheck.description"
msgstr "Automatically checks each submission on arrival: metadata, length, author anonymisation for double-blind review, comments and tracked changes, required headings, references and Quran-verifier results, with a ready-made message to the author. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah for Research and Studies."

